   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 200097,
   "updated": 1,
   "boundElements": null,
   "text": "RRF: each source contributes independently, so a hit found by BOTH ranks higher than either alone.  Zoekt is a TRIGRAM index doing substring/regex\nmatching \u2014 not BM25, and not scored by term frequency.  The 500-char cap and limit=10 are fixed caps, not context-window-aware budgets:\ncodeintel does not count the agent's tokens.  Transport is stdio JSON-RPC only \u2014 no HTTP, so no SSE streaming.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "RRF: each source contributes independently, so a hit found by BOTH ranks higher than either alone.  Zoekt is a TRIGRAM index doing substring/regex\nmatching \u2014 not BM25, and not scored by term frequency.  The 500-char cap and limit=10 are fixed caps, not context-window-aware budgets:\ncodeintel does not count the agent's tokens.  Transport is stdio JSON-RPC only \u2014 no HTTP, so no SSE streaming.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
 ],
